    >>> x = jnp.array([0, 1, 2, jnp.nan, 3, 4, 5, 6])
    >>> q = jnp.array([0.25, 0.5, 0.75])

    Because of the NaN value, :func:`jax.numpy.quantile` returns all NaNs,
